# Masterclass promo (live ↔ replay)

Single source of truth: `src/lib/masterclass-promo.ts` (`MASTERCLASS_PROMO`).

Per-session Luma short links live in `src/lib/site-redirects.ts` (`/masterclass01`, `/masterclass02`, …).

## Cadence

- **Before the live session (weeks leading up):** `mode: "live"`. Update `sessions[]` (labels + `/masterclass0N` hrefs), `toasterLine1` / `toasterLine2`, and `liveUrl` (usually the first session). Point each `/masterclass0N` redirect at the current Luma event.
- **After the session, when Tim asks to "post up the replay":** set `mode: "replay"`. Toaster + `/masterclass` go to `replayPath` (EO signup that emails / redirects to the replay). Keep monthly replay gates like `/masterclassreplayaug26` as needed.

## Do not

- Do not hardcode Luma destinations in the toaster — use short links from `sessions[]` / redirects.
- Do not ship unrelated wheel-of-names / other WIP when updating masterclass promo.

## Deploy

After changing `MASTERCLASS_PROMO` or redirects, commit those files and push to `main` only when Tim asks to push to prod. Restart local Next if redirect changes do not apply (config is loaded at boot).
